{"metadata":{"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"slug":[{"Plain":"余米田引理"},0],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"title":[{"Plain":"余米田引理"},2]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>陈述</h2>\n<p>设 $(\\mathcal V,\\otimes,[-,-])$ 为完备, 余完备闭"},{"Local":{"url":"对称幺半范畴","text":"对称幺半范畴"}},{"Plain":", $\\mathcal C$ 为 $\\mathcal V$-"},{"Local":{"url":"充实范畴","text":"充实范畴"}},{"Plain":". 设 $X\\colon \\mathcal C^{\\mathrm{op}}\\to\\mathcal V$ 是 $\\mathcal C$ 上的"},{"Local":{"url":"预层","text":"预层"}},{"Plain":". 记 $\\mathbf{y}\\colon \\mathcal C\\to \\mathsf{Fun}_{\\mathcal V}(\\mathcal C^{\\mathrm{op}},\\mathcal V)$ 为"},{"Local":{"url":"米田嵌入","text":"米田嵌入"}},{"Plain":". 那么 $X$ 可展开为"},{"Local":{"url":"余端","text":"余端"}},{"Plain":" ("},{"Local":{"url":"加权余极限","text":"加权余极限"}},{"Plain":")\n$$\r\nX(c)\\simeq \\int_{c'\\in\\mathcal C} X(c') \\otimes \\operatorname{Hom}(c,c').\r\n$$</p>\n<p>这与如下形式的"},{"Local":{"url":"米田引理","text":"米田引理"}},{"Plain":"相对偶:\n$$\r\nX(c) \\simeq \\int_{c'\\in\\mathcal C}^* [\\operatorname{Hom}(c',c),X(c')].\r\n$$</p>\n"}]}}